OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for throwing drugs into
OL,4,Aprison
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who threw a package containing
OL,7,Fillegal drugs with a street value of
OL,8,Fmore than #12,000 into a prison has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed.
OL,11,FPolice received a report on 11 July
OL,12,Flast year from a prison guard at HMP
OL,13,FHull who saw a parcel falling over the
OL,14,Fwall after it had been thrown by
OL,15,F30-year-old Joshua Smith.
OL,17,FOn Monday, Smith, of no fixed address,
OL,18,Fwas sentenced at Hull Crown Court to
OL,19,Fthree years and eight months in jail
OL,20,Fafter pleading guilty at an earlier
OL,21,Fhearing to two counts of throwing a
OL,22,Fprohibited article into a prison.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
